          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Related categories</span></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/content/stryker/us/en/portfolios/medical-surgical-equipment.html\">Medical and surgical equipment</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/content/stryker/us/en/portfolios/medical-surgical-equipment/patient-cleansing.html\">Patient cleansing</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/content/stryker/us/en/portfolios/medical-surgical-equipment/patient-cleansing/incontinence-care.html\">Incontinence care</a></p>\n",
