          "jcr:created": "Tue Feb 27 2024 15:27:31 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Use as part of your incontinence skin care strategy for additional clean-up or for patients who don't require the advanced protection provided by Sage Barrier Cream Cloths.</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Contains ample solution to effectively clean soiled areas</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Efficient, one-step clean-up with moisturizer preserves patient dignity</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Helps enhance compliance to your incontinence skin cleansing protocol</span></li>\n</ul>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Mar 01 2024 15:40:05 GMT+0000",
